      "interpretation": "map is an actual family of functions between section types. respectsDifferential and quasiIsoLike are arbitrary supplied Props with witnesses, not equations about the map or an isomorphism definition."
    },
    {
      "name": "Dependent Euler records and actual value equality",
      "source_span": {
        "start": 953,
