        "line_end": 47
      },
      "interpretation": "sourceEuler : EulerCharacteristic A and targetEuler : EulerCharacteristic B retain their dependent types; euler_eq is an actual equation targetEuler.value = sourceEuler.value. It is supplied independently of the map rather than derived from a transport law."
